@@ -5,6 +5,35 @@ Benchmark & held-out performance for the current model ablation: **4 datasets ×
 hasn't been run yet, `n/a` where the benchmark/condition doesn't apply to that
 model.
 
+## LR RETUNE MILESTONE (2026-07-16) — first above-chance wiki model
+
+The 2026-07-01..07 runs were undertrained + LR-mis-tuned (all at chance; see
+below). An 8-point muon_lr sweep on **wiki_merged / doc_causal** (VE banks OFF,
+4-epoch data-repeat = ~14.5k steps / ~3.8B tok, cooldown + untie now actually
+firing) found the inherited `muon_lr=0.001` was ~3× too low. **Final val_loss
+U-curve bottoms at muon_lr≈0.003** (basin 0.002–0.004 within 0.03, noise-tight);
+0.001 was 2nd-worst. adamw_lr scaled at muon_lr×0.01.
+
+Winner (muon_lr=0.003, fully trained to step 14438, `doceval`, max_docs=1000):
+
+| metric | value | chance | verdict |
+|--------|:-----:|:------:|---------|
+| held_out perplexity | **ppl 4.00 / nll 1.387** | — | vs old undertrained ppl ~124–137 |
+| hellaswag | **0.333** [.304,.361] | 0.25 | ✅ **above chance** (CI clears) |
+| arc_easy | **0.333** [.305,.363] | 0.25 | ✅ **above chance** (CI clears) |
+| piqa | 0.524 [.492,.554] | 0.50 | ≈ chance |
+| winogrande | 0.509 [.479,.539] | 0.50 | ≈ chance |
+| openbookqa | 0.216 [.182,.252] | 0.25 | ≈ chance |
+| boolq | 0.387 [.355,.417] | 0.50 | below (yes/no likelihood-scoring artifact) |
+
+First wiki model **statistically above chance** (hellaswag + arc_easy) — the old
+ablation was indistinguishable from chance on everything. Config: 1024d/24L/8H,
+`ve_layers: []`, `weight_tying:true` + `untie_at_frac:0.667`, cooldown_frac 0.4,
+min_lr_ratio 0.1. Run dir `runs/20260715_232111...` (job 45065). Pending: seed-43
+replica + doc_concatenated LR-transfer confirm; then a weight-decay sweep at 0.003.
+
+---
+
 > Last updated: 2026-07-13. All numbers below regenerated in a full 12-model
 > re-sweep on the verified-sound eval path (max_docs=2000, seed=0, `doceval`
 > condition for single-doc benchmarks, `experimental` for cross-doc/community).

diff --git a/configs/arxiv_sweep/arxiv_veoff_cdl_wd0p3.yaml b/configs/arxiv_sweep/arxiv_veoff_cdl_wd0p3.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1234567
--- /dev/null
+++ b/configs/arxiv_sweep/arxiv_veoff_cdl_wd0p3.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,92 @@
+# ARXIV SWEEP — veoff_cdl_wd0p3: mask=cross_doc_link ve=off muon_lr=0.003 muon_wd=0.3, 15000 steps.
+data:
+  dataset_dir: /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv
+  strategy: 'bfs'
+  layout_policy: 'stochastic_latex_comment_prefix'
+  inference_layout_policy: 'eos'
+  order_mode: 'prefer_targets_first'
+  doc_budget: null
+  train_dir:   /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv/splits/train
+  epoch_dirs:  /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/schedules/arxiv_bfs/epoch_0
+  val_dirs:
+    val_community: /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv/splits/val_community
+    val_random:    /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv/splits/val_random
+  test_dirs:
+    test_community: /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv/splits/test_community
+    test_random:    /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv/splits/test_random
+
+model:
+  compile: true
+  compile_mode: 'default'
+  attention_backend: 'triton'
+  inference_attention_backend: 'flex'
+  mask_type: 'cross_doc_link'
+  activation_checkpointing: false
+  model_dim: 1024
+  num_layers: 24
+  num_heads: 8    # 8H × 128Dh = 1024
+  max_seq_len: 32768
+  drop_path_rate: 0.0
+  fp8: false
+  weight_tying: true
+  untie_at_frac: 0.667
+  ignore_index: -100
+  dtype: 'bfloat16'
+  logit_softcap: 30.0
+  mtp_extra_weights: [0.5, 0.25]
+  mtp_decay_steps: 0
+  ve_layers: []
+  shared_ve_bank: false
+
+optimizer:
+  type: 'muon'
+  muon_wd: 0.3
+  adamw_wd: 0.005
+  momentum: 0.95
+  muon_beta2: 0.95
+  beta1: 0.9
+  beta2: 0.95
+  muon_lr: 0.003
+  adamw_lr: 3e-05
+  muon_momentum_warmup_steps: 300
+  adamw_embed_beta1: 0.5
+
+train_loop:
+  epochs: 1
+  max_optimizer_steps: 15000   # fixed budget ~3.9B tok (<1 arxiv epoch); enables cooldown+untie
+  warmup_steps: 300
+  cooldown_frac: 0.4
+  min_lr_ratio: 0.1
+  val_steps: 20
+  val_interval: 250
+  # Overwrite a single latest.pt every N optimizer steps (independent of val)
+  # so a kill/preemption loses at most N steps. Set to val_interval here.
+  # latest.pt embeds full optimizer state (>model size) — written to /fss-data
+  # each time; resume with --resume-from <run>/checkpoints/latest.pt (or best_model.pt).
+  save_latest_interval: 250
+  atomic_feature_kwargs:
+    norm_clip_value: 1.0
+    accum_steps: 1
+
+seed: 42
+
+eval:
+  run_on_completion: true
+  benchmarks:
+    - {name: held_out_perplexity,       conditions: [doceval]}
+    - {name: community_pack_perplexity, conditions: [doceval]}
+    - {name: hellaswag,   conditions: [doceval]}
+    - {name: boolq,       conditions: [doceval]}
+    - {name: openbookqa,  conditions: [doceval]}
+  max_docs: 500
+  annotator_corpus: /fss-data/evin_t/tagseq2tagseq_artifacts/pretokenized_datasets/arxiv
+  annotator_mode: corpus_only
+  annotator_strategies: [exact, norm, word_overlap_ordered]
+
+# --- Smoke-test overrides (pass on CLI, don't edit here) ---
+# --model.model_dim 256 --model.num_layers 4 --model.num_heads 4
+# --model.max_seq_len 2048
+# --model.mtp_extra_weights '[]' --model.ve_layers '[]'
+# --train_loop.max_optimizer_steps 5 --train_loop.val_steps 2 --train_loop.val_interval 3
+# --eval.max_docs 20
+

